\* The code as it is, plus one PR page refresh that runs beside the crawl.
\* Converged and RawNeverGoesBack must hold.
\* Smaller bounds: a second lane that runs at the same time grows the state space fast.
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 1
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 0
    MaxHourly = 1
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = @AdvanceNeedsFullList@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = TRUE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = TRUE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged RawNeverGoesBack
